  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking: built on ByteShelfCommon 4.0.0, where ShelfKeyPermission is ShelfPermission, and needs a ByteShelf server 3.0.0 or later for shelf info and key sign-in. IShelfClient gains SetPluginDocumentAsync, OpenDerivedAsync and OpenDeletedDerivedAsync, which an implementation of its own must add; the HTTP and in-memory clients have them. Search takes FileCriteria.PluginFields. See https://github.com/AdamTovatt/byte-shelf/blob/client-v4.0.0/ByteShelfClient/README.md",
